Package: newconvert9918
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Cisco Garcia
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libgl1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0
Description: Cross-platform image converter for TMS9918A and F18A graphics
 New Convert 9918 converts common and retro image formats into deterministic
 TMS9918A and F18A graphics data and includes a graphical editor and CLI.
Homepage: https://github.com/CiscoGarciaFL/NewConvert9918
